# The badge artwork is copied byte for byte from the entrance site
# (NextOneTwoLabs/nextonetwo-website). This repo has no other .gitattributes
# and core.autocrlf=true on the maintainer machine, so without these rules
# badge.svg (which contains LF line breaks) would be committed correctly and
# then expanded to CRLF on the next checkout, breaking byte-identity with the
# entrance site. Treat all image assets as binary: no line-ending conversion.
*.svg -text
*.png -text
